@startuml
title Step 3 - Test Fiber Product Technical Eligibility

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "PartyInteractionManagement" as PIM
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM
participant "ServiceQualificationManagement" as SQM

person -> EM : 20 provide address or phoneNumber for eligibility
activate EM

EM -> SQM : 21 **TMF645 Service Qualification** POST /checkServiceQualification\n(CFSSpec(s), phone number or address)
activate SQM
SQM --> EM : 22 **TMF645** 201 Created\nEligibility result
deactivate SQM

EM -> EM : 23 display eligibility result

person -> EM : 24 select an offer
EM -> PIM : 25 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/3/taskFlow/2\nsessionId, taskId2 (start order), offering25, partyId8
deactivate EM

@enduml
